.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH change 1  "change " 
.SH NAME
change \- Manage multi\-operation change transactions
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBchange\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Manage multi\-operation change transactions
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
change\-begin(1)
Open a new multi\-operation change transaction
.TP
change\-status(1)
Inspect status and staged operations of the open change transaction
.TP
change\-commit(1)
Commit all staged operations into a single ChangeRevision and publish
.TP
change\-abort(1)
Abort the open change transaction and discard all staged operations
.TP
change\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
